        "html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:96px 32px 88px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:32px;position:relative;\">\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden;border-radius:0;\">\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:-60px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(196,135,58,0.18) 0%,rgba(30,23,16,0) 70%);\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:32px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid rgba(196,135,58,0.45);border-radius:100px;\">\n      <span style=\"display:block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#C4873A;\"></span>\n      <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:#C4873A;\">CORE CAMPUS · NEW COURSE</span>\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,84px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#F5F0E8;margin:0;max-width:780px;\">\n      전환이 막히는 건<br>\n      <span style=\"color:#E8C97A;\">가격의 문제가 아닙니다</span>\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(245,240,232,0.72);max-width:520px;margin:0;\">Claude를 활용해 고객이 납득하는 가격 페이지를 직접 설계합니다. 카피·구조·심리 트리거를 한 코스에서.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;\">\n      <a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:18px 48px;background:#C4873A;color:#1E1710;font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;border-radius:var(--radius-card,8px);letter-spacing:0.01em;\">지금 수강 신청 →</a>\n      <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:13px;color:rgba(245,240,232,0.45);\">4주 과정 · 평생 수강</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:100%;max-width:640px;margin-top:24px;padding:28px 32px;background:rgba(46,37,24,0.8);border-radius:var(--radius-card,8px);border:1px solid rgba(196,135,58,0.2);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:0;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;padding:0 16px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#E8C97A;\">3배</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:12px;color:rgba(245,240,232,0.55);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5;\">평균 전환율<br>개선 목표</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;padding:0 16px;border-left:1px solid rgba(196,135,58,0.2);border-right:1px solid rgba(196,135,58,0.2);\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#E8C97A;\">12강</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:12px;color:rgba(245,240,232,0.55);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5;\">실전 레슨<br>즉시 적용</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;padding:0 16px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#E8C97A;\">Claude</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-family-sans,'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:12px;color:rgba(245,240,232,0.55);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5;\">AI 기반<br>실습 설계</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
